{"suttaId":"tha-ap210","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7545,7560],"vripara":"35"},"segments":{"tha-ap210:0.3":"Koraṇḍapupphiyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap210:1.1":"“Akkantañca padaṃ disvā, cakkālaṅkārabhūsitaṃ;","tha-ap210:1.3":"Padenānupadaṃ yanto, vipassissa mahesino.","tha-ap210:2.1":"“Koraṇḍaṃ pupphitaṃ disvā, samūlaṃ pūjitaṃ mayā;","tha-ap210:2.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, avandiṃ padamuttamaṃ.","tha-ap210:3.1":"“Ekanavutito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap210:3.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap210:4.1":"“Sattapaññāsakappamhi, eko vītamalo ahuṃ;","tha-ap210:4.3":"Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap210:5.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap210:6.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā koraṇḍapupphiyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap210:7.1":"Koraṇḍapupphiyattherassāpadānaṃ aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
